  <div class="g3"><div class="card reveal" style="min-height:240px"><p class="label" style="margin:0 0 14px">Step 01</p><h3 class="disp" style="font-size:28px;margin:0 0 12px">Brief</h3><p class="p" style="font-size:15px">We agree your goals, your buyers and the brand rules the site has to follow.</p></div><div class="card reveal" style="min-height:240px"><p class="label" style="margin:0 0 14px">Step 02</p><h3 class="disp" style="font-size:28px;margin:0 0 12px">Design</h3><p class="p" style="font-size:15px">Layouts and a visual system, reviewed by you before anything is built.</p></div><div class="card reveal" style="min-height:240px"><p class="label" style="margin:0 0 14px">Step 03</p><h3 class="disp" style="font-size:28px;margin:0 0 12px">Handover</h3><p class="p" style="font-size:15px">Design files and simple rules, so new pages stay consistent after launch.</p></div></div>
